{
  "description": "Language-agnostic vectors of the thermal span range: a symmetric range of plus and minus spanK kelvin around the air temperature. The signed fraction is (value - air) / spanK clamped to [-1, 1]; the shared range of -20 to 60 degC reads the same value as (value - air) / (60 - air) above and (value - air) / (air + 20) below the air temperature. The legend of the span range spans air - spanK to air + spanK.",
